      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:slides_foss",
      "text": "The slides_foss module exposes core presentation processing types including Presentation, Slide, Shape, TextFrame, Paragraph, Portion, Chart, SaveFormat, Color, TransitionType, and CommentAuthor."
