        "package:version"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:2",
      "text": "Rendering and conversion to PDF, HTML, XPS, or images is not implemented, and presentation sections, slide size, SmartArt, OLE objects, mathematical text, VBA macros, digital signatures, encryption, and most action settings are absent."
    },
